# STAGE B — New env system online (cadence + spawns + behaviors + targeting)

**Prompt**

> You are working in the deterministic sim.
> Non-negotiable invariants:
>
> * Determinism suite must pass.
> * Time travel scrubbing must reproduce identical env spawns and outcomes for the same timeline.
> * All randomness must use `state.rng` only.
> * No non-serializable state.
>
> Objective:
>
> * Turn on the new environment system:
>
>   * env events spawn from env tiles using cadence + seasonTables
>   * env event behaviors execute through the existing behavior→effect pipeline
>   * env events can target tiles and permanents in the same columns (span-aware)
>
> Required implementation:
>
> 1. Cadence spawning:
>
>    * Add a rule: every `intervalSec` (default 5s), spawn/refresh env events from tiles.
>    * Cadence must be keyed to `tSec` (and optionally `seasonAnchorSec`).
>    * For each tile (anchor col only), pick an env event from that tile’s `seasonTables[currentSeasonKey]` using weights and `state.rng`.
>    * Create/replace an `EnvCardInstance` with `{col, span, createdSec, expiresSec?}`.
>    * Rebuild occupancy arrays after spawning.
>    * Define clear replacement policy for card-vs-card overlap (recommended: replace existing events covering those columns).
> 2. Behavior execution:
>
>    * Extend the update loop to iterate active env cards from `state.board.env.cardsById` (prefer anchors; but effects should target by occupied columns).
>    * Reuse existing behavior engine patterns.
>    * Provide context including `{ layer:"card", col, span, cardId }` and access to underlying tile/permanent via column lookup.
> 3. Targeting:
>
>    * Implement board-aware target resolution supporting:
>
>      * `{layer:"tile"|"card"|"permanent", col}`
>      * `"self"`, `"under"`, `"sameCol"`
>      * span-aware iteration (effects that apply across the occupied columns)
>    * Replace/augment `envSlotIndex` ad-hoc targeting for new env events with this system (do not remove legacy targeting yet).
> 4. Effects:
>
>    * Add minimal new EffectOps to mutate:
>
>      * tile props
>      * permanent props
>      * resources (already exists)
>      * remove/transform env cards
>    * Keep the rest of effects system intact.
> 5. Placeholder content:
>
>    * Update some EnvEventDefs to demonstrate:
>
>      * AddResource (gold)
>      * AddProp/SetProp on underlying tile (moisture, fertility)
>      * SetProp/AddProp on permanent in same column (e.g. “stress” meter)
>      * One multi-span storm event (span=3)
>
> Constraints:
>
> * Do NOT delete legacy envSlots/envSeasons yet.
> * Ensure replay/projection still work: rebuilding state at second should reproduce cadence outcomes.
> * Avoid deep architectural rewrites; integrate with existing update loop.
>
> Deliverables:
>
> * Code changes with clear comments marking new-system paths.
> * Smoke test checklist:
>
>   1. determinism suite
>   2. run app for 20s unpaused and observe env events changing every 5s
>   3. scrub backwards/forwards across cadence boundaries and verify events match
>   4. open time graphs; confirm gold changes if defined
>
> Acceptance criteria:
>
> * Determinism suite passes.
> * Cadence spawns are stable under replay and scrubbing.
> * Env events can affect tile props and permanent props deterministically.
> * No crashes in projection/timegraphs.

